39
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:31,000
They would have to carry their own gear and feed and take care of themselves.

40
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:35,000
I was actually not surprised about their Scouts attitude.

41
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:41,000
That sort of independence is a culture that needs to be deliberately woven into the personality of the truth.

42
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Lord Baden Powell was right when he said

43
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:48,000
